---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Menu from "../components/Menu.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import "../styles/about.scss";
---

<BaseLayout>
    <script is:inline slot="head" src="/javascripts/about.js"></script>

    <Menu />

    <div class="container-fluid">
        <div class="col-sm-10 col-sm-offset-2">
            <h2>Shuyang <span id="self_description"></span>.</h2>
            <p>
                I’m a member of technical staff working on frontier AI products,
                infrastructure, and performance.
            </p>
            <p>
                Previously, I was a member of technical staff at <a
                    href="https://github.com/tensorzero/tensorzero"
                    >TensorZero</a
                >, a staff software engineer at <a
                    href="https://www.google.com/">Google Search</a
                >, and a software engineer at <a
                    href="https://www.palantir.com/">Palantir</a
                >.
            </p>
            <p>
                I enjoy technology, art, design, and I want to use them to
                enrich people's lives. I’m also curious about how AI could
                change how we live and work, and I want to build at that
                boundary.
            </p>
            <p>
                Things I appreciate, in no particular order:
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        <a
                            href="https://www.nngroup.com/books/design-everyday-things-revised/"
                            >The Design of Everyday Things</a
                        >
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <a href="https://ordinaryabundance.com/"
                            >Ordinary Abundance</a
                        >
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <a
                            href="https://darioamodei.com/essay/machines-of-loving-grace"
                            >Machines of Loving Grace</a
                        >
                    </li>
                    <li><a href="https://radiolab.org/">Radiolab</a></li>
                    <li>
                        <a href="https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/"
                            >Hermes Agent</a
                        > (and <a
                            href="https://shuyangli.substack.com/p/my-ai-writes-to-my-apple-health-in"
                            >why</a
                        >)
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <a
                            href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/4080030/The_Message_from_Deep_Space/"
                            >The Message from Deep Space</a
                        >
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <a
                            href="https://www.nytimes.com/2016/06/26/style/bill-cunningham-legendary-times-fashion-photographer-dies-at-87.html?unlocked_article_code=1.51A.rduc.Nk_AKZfeGSfQ&smid=url-share"
                            >Bill Cunningham</a>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <a href="https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0770802/"
                            >Samsara</a
                        >
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
